    <tags>razorfind search file-search duplicate-finder desktop-search fast windows</tags>
    <summary>Whole-drive file search in milliseconds with duplicate finder &amp; folder sizes.</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[Find any file or folder on your PC the moment you start typing — with millisecond whole-drive search, true duplicate-content detection, real folder sizes, and zero ads or tracking.

Instant Results in Milliseconds: Search entire drives as you type — no more waiting on slow default Windows search. True Duplicate File Finder: Finds identical-content duplicate files (even if they have different filenames) so you can quickly spot and clear wasted space. See Real Folder Sizes: Tick one box to calculate true folder sizes and instantly spot which folders are filling up your drive. Always Up to Date Automatically: Quietly picks up new, renamed, or moved files in the background without slowing your PC down.

Licensing: RazorFind is free to download and use for personal or commercial use — no licence key, no subscription, no adverts, no tracking, and no account required. Requires Windows 10 or 11 (64-bit). Details at https://razorlinestudios.co.uk/app.php?slug=razorfind.]]></description>
    <releaseNotes>https://razorlinestudios.co.uk/app.php?slug=razorfind</releaseNotes>
